              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "VuAC0",
                  "fill": "#22C55E",
                  "content": "COLOR TOKENS",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "f9JgK",
                  "fill": "#475569",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 888,
                  "content": "LIGHT MODE / DARK MODE\nPage bg          #FFFFFF / #0F172A\nSidebar bg       #F1F5F9 / #1E293B\nCard border      #E2E8F0 / #334155  (1px all sides)\nTab separator    #E2E8F0 / #334155\nSidebar edge     #E2E8F0 / #334155  (right 1px)\n\nText primary     #1C2333 / #F1F5F9\nText secondary   #6B7585 / #94A3B8\nText muted       #94A3B8 / #64748B\nText label       #8B95A5 / #64748B\n\nAccent green     #22C55E  (same both modes)\nGreen bg tint    #E0F8ED / #14532D\nNav active       stroke left 3px #22C55E\nTab indicator    2px bottom #22C55E\n\nISO functional   #3B82F6\nISO structural   #7C3AED\nISO maintain.    #22C55E\nISO performance  #9333EA\nISO reliability  #EAB308\n\nIcon default     #94A3B8 / #64748B\nBtn bg           #F8FAFC / #1E293B\nBtn border       #E2E8F0 / #334155\nBtn active bg    #E0F8ED / #14532D",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "kNNuf",
              "name": "s-interaction",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#F8FAFC",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#E2E8F0",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "strokeAlignment": "inner",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "jeoAD",
                  "fill": "#22C55E",
                  "content": "INTERACTION MODEL",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ckkWq",
                  "fill": "#475569",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 888,
                  "content": "ACCORDION — one card open at a time\n• Default: most recent week expanded on load\n• Click expander on closed card → expands it, closes previous\n• Click expander on open card → collapses (nothing open)\n• Chevron: chevron-right closed / chevron-down open\n\nSPY-SCROLL SYNC\n• IntersectionObserver watches which card dominates viewport\n• Scrolling auto-updates nav active item\n• Clicking nav item: expands that card + scrolls into view\n• Nav active state and expanded card stay in sync\n\nGREEN ACCENT RULE\n• stroke: { left: 3px, #22C55E } lives on CardExpanded only\n• CardExpanded is display:none when collapsed\n• Closed card: uniform card-border (1px) on all sides\n• Open card: card-border all sides + 3px green left stroke\n  scoped to release list height — NOT the full card height\n• No card-level class toggle needed — border is structural",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "LTDny",
          "x": 980,
          "y": 1450,
