                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XmuQr",
                  "fill": "#22C55E",
                  "content": "TYPOGRAPHY",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "kq3zY",
                  "fill": "#475569",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 888,
                  "content": "USE                   SIZE  WT   COLOR\nCard headline         15px  600  text-primary  (#1C2333 / #F1F5F9)\nCard body/summary     13px  400  text-secondary\nCard date header      10px  600  text-label  (UPPERCASE)\nCard aggregate stats  11px  400  text-muted\nExpander label        13px  500  #22C55E\n\nTab active label      13px  500  #22C55E\nTab inactive label    13px  400  text-secondary\n\nNav item active       13px  500  text-primary  (bold)\nNav item inactive     13px  400  text-secondary\nMonth group header    10px  600  text-muted  (UPPERCASE)\nTimeline label        12px  500  text-secondary\nTimeline count        12px  400  text-muted\n\nRelease title         13px  600  text-primary\nRelease summary       12px  400  text-secondary\nRelease PR ref        12px  400  #3B82F6\nRelease fn. area      10px  400  text-muted\nRelease meta          10px  400  text-muted\n\nISO bar labels        10px  400  ISO category color\nFont: Inter — weights 400, 500, 600",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "h79L0",
              "name": "s-iso",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#F8FAFC",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#E2E8F0",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "strokeAlignment": "inner",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "6gQ5d",
                  "fill": "#22C55E",
                  "content": "ISO BAR + RELEASE ITEM",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "FpwKv",
                  "fill": "#475569",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 888,
                  "content": "ISO BAR (width: 850px, matches headline width)\n• SegmentRow — 4px tall, cornerRadius 2\n  First seg: cornerRadius [2,0,0,2]\n  Last seg:  cornerRadius [0,2,2,0] · Inner segs: cornerRadius 0\n  Widths proportional to release count per ISO category\n• LabelRow — 14px tall, gap 6 below SegmentRow\n  Each label width = exact segment width (fixed-width text)\n  Label color = segment fill color, 10px/400\n\nISO CHIP (pill badge in card header)\n• Padding [2,8], cornerRadius 4\n• Background: ISO color at ~10% opacity\n• Text: ISO color, 10px/500\n\nRELEASE ITEM (layout vert, gap 4, padding [12,0])\n• TitleRow — layout horiz, gap 8, alignItems center\n  Title       13px/600  text-primary\n  PR ref      12px/400  #3B82F6  (e.g. \"#189\")\n  Fn. area    10px/400  text-muted  (e.g. \"Change Detection\")\n• Summary    — 12px/400  text-secondary  max-width ~856px\n• Meta       — 10px/400  text-muted\n  (e.g. \"28 files · 4 components · API + Core\")\nNo dividers between items — gap 16px provides breathing room.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
