                  "letterSpacing": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uO5a6",
                  "fill": "#475569",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 888,
                  "content": "Screen (1440 × 1000, cornerRadius 8)\n├── Sidebar (200px fixed, clip true)\n│   layout vert, bg sidebar-bg, border-right 1px\n└── ContentArea (1240px, clip true)\n    ├── TopBar (48px, padding [0,16], border-bottom 1px)\n    │   └── panel-left icon (18×18, icon-default)\n    └── Main (fills height, layout vert, gap 16, padding [24,40,0,40])\n        ├── Breadcrumb (18px)\n        ├── TitleRow (36px)\n        ├── TabSection (layout vert, gap 0)\n        │   ├── TabRow (40px, layout horiz, gap 8)\n        │   └── Separator (1px line, fill-width)\n        └── TabContent (fills height, layout horiz, gap 20)\n            ├── NavPanel (210px, layout vert)\n            └── CardsArea (fills width, layout vert, gap 12)",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "0n0qk",
              "name": "s-tabbar",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#F8FAFC",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#E2E8F0",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "strokeAlignment": "inner",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "rLezv",
                  "fill": "#22C55E",
                  "content": "TAB BAR",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "z3K6Y",
                  "fill": "#475569",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 888,
                  "content": "ACTIVE TAB — layout vertical, justifyContent space-between\npadding [10, 16, 0, 16]\n  Label \"History\" — 13px/500 #22C55E — sits at top via padding-top:10\n  Indicator — fill_container width, 2px, #22C55E — pinned to bottom\n  The indicator visually touches the separator below with no gap.\n\nINACTIVE TABS — layout horizontal, alignItems center\n  padding [0, 16] · Label: 13px/400 text-secondary · No indicator\n\nGEAR BUTTON — 28×28, cornerRadius 6, btn-bg, btn-border\n  Spacer (fill_container) before it pushes it to the right end of TabRow\n\nKEY: TabSection must use gap:0 (not the inherited gap:16 from Main)\nso the 2px active indicator visually touches the 1px separator — zero gap.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "30j5D",
              "name": "s-cards",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#F8FAFC",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#E2E8F0",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "strokeAlignment": "inner",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MIXvA",
                  "fill": "#22C55E",
                  "content": "CARD ANATOMY",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "KpV28",
                  "fill": "#475569",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 888,
                  "content": "COLLAPSED (layout vert, gap 10, padding 20, border 1px card-border)\n├── HeaderRow (28px, space-between, alignItems center)\n│   ├── Date label + ISO chip\n│   └── \"N releases · N files · N components\" (11px/400 muted)\n├── Headline (15px/600, max-width ~850px)\n└── ExpanderRow (28px) — chevron-right + \"N releases this week\"\n\nEXPANDED (layout vert, gap 0, padding 0, border 1px card-border)\n├── CardTop (layout vert, gap 12, padding [20,20,12,20])\n│   ├── HeaderRow (28px, space-between)\n│   ├── Headline (15px/600)\n│   ├── ISOBar (width 850px)\n│   ├── Summary (13px/400, max-width 850px)\n│   └── ExpanderRow (chevron-down + label)\n└── CardExpanded (padding [0,20,20,17], stroke LEFT 3px #22C55E)\n    └── ReleaseList (layout vert, gap 16)\n\nPADDING MATH\nCardTop pad-bottom 12 + CardExpanded pad-top 0 = 12px between\nexpander toggle and first release item.\nCardExpanded left-pad 17 + 3px stroke = 20px from card edge,\nmatching CardTop content left edge.",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "qc9KR",
              "name": "s-assets",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#F8FAFC",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "stroke": "#E2E8F0",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "strokeAlignment": "inner",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XsP7s",
                  "fill": "#22C55E",
                  "content": "ASSETS + CHECKLIST",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "j1Grx",
                  "fill": "#475569",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 888,
                  "content": "LUCIDE ICONS\npanel-left           Sidebar toggle (TopBar)\nsearch               Nav panel search button\nlayout-grid          Nav panel group-by (active state in mock)\nsliders-horizontal   Nav panel filter button\nsettings             Tab bar gear button\nchevron-right        Collapsed card expander\nchevron-down         Expanded card expander\n\nFONTS\nInter — weights 400, 500, 600 (Google Fonts or bundled)\n\nCOMPONENT BUILD CHECKLIST\n□ TabBar — indicator touches separator (TabSection gap: 0)\n□ NavPanel — IntersectionObserver, bold/normal active states\n□ NavItem — active: bold + green bg + 3px left stroke\n□ SummaryCard — header + headline + ISO chip + expander toggle\n□ HeroCard — CardTop + CardExpanded structural split\n□ ISOBar — proportional segments, label widths match segments\n□ ISOChip — tinted pill badge in ISO category color\n□ ReleaseItem — title + PR ref + fn area + summary + meta\n□ ExpanderToggle — chevron-right ↔ chevron-down swap",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
