                              "fill": "#6B7585",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "This change separates payment logic from order processing, reducing coupling across 8 components. The refactoring improves maintainability by isolating payment-specific retry and error handling logic. Teams can now deploy payment updates independently without risking order flow regressions.",
