    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "GnV6x",
      "x": 15400,
      "y": -458,
      "name": "Diff View Spec Notes",
      "width": 920,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "9NN9z",
          "name": "s-anatomy",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F8FAFC",
          "cornerRadius": 8,
          "stroke": "#E2E8F0",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "strokeAlignment": "inner",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "padding": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "let4m",
              "name": "s1h",
              "fill": "#22C55E",
              "content": "DIFF VIEW ANATOMY",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "JYWwy",
              "name": "s1b",
              "fill": "#475569",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 888,
              "content": "BackNav: 28px height, \"← Back to timeline\" in #22C55E, 13px/500.\nLucide arrow-left icon 16×16.\n\nDiffHeader: layout horiz, space-between, padding 20,\nborder 1px card-border, cornerRadius 8.\n\nFrom/To sections: layout vert, gap 4.\n\"FROM\"/\"TO\" labels 10px/600 text-muted UPPERCASE.\nCommit SHA in Roboto Mono 13px/400.\nDate in Inter 12px/400. Checkpoint name in Inter 14px/600.\n\nArrow separator: \"→\" text, 16px, text-muted, alignSelf center.\n\nNarrativeCard: fill sidebar-bg, padding 20, cornerRadius 8.\n\"WHAT CHANGED\" label 12px/600 + headline 15px/600 +\nimpact paragraph 13px/400 lineHeight 1.5.\n\nMetricsRow: layout horiz, gap 16, padding [12,20].\nIcon (14×14 lucide) + metric text pairs.\nGreen for added (#22C55E), red for removed (#EF4444).\n1px vertical divider between counts and deltas.\n\nComponentList: layout vert, gap 8.\nEach item: status badge + name + file path + ISO chip.\nItems have padding [12,16], cornerRadius 8, 1px card-border.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "3S0s2",
          "name": "s-badges",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F8FAFC",
          "cornerRadius": 8,
          "stroke": "#E2E8F0",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "strokeAlignment": "inner",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "padding": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "FgBHg",
              "name": "s2h",
              "fill": "#22C55E",
              "content": "STATUS BADGES",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "OCD5I",
              "name": "s2b",
              "fill": "#475569",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 888,
              "content": "Added:    bg #DCFCE7 / #052E16, text #166534 / #4ADE80\nModified: bg #FEF3C7 / #422006, text #92400E / #FCD34D\nRemoved:  bg #FEE2E2 / #450A0A, text #991B1B / #FCA5A5\n\nAll badges: 10px/600 Inter, padding [2,8], cornerRadius 6.\nFirst value is light mode, second is dark mode.",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 11,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "OpGz4",
          "name": "s-interaction",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#F8FAFC",
          "cornerRadius": 8,
          "stroke": "#E2E8F0",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "strokeAlignment": "inner",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "padding": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "VpUg1",
              "name": "s3h",
              "fill": "#22C55E",
              "content": "INTERACTION NOTES",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "700",
              "letterSpacing": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "VsBhG",
              "name": "s3b",
              "fill": "#475569",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 888,
              "content": "• Back nav returns to the History timeline (same tab, not a\n  new page). Uses router-level navigation.\n• Clicking a snapshot in the timeline opens this diff view.\n• The \"from\" snapshot is always the previous snapshot;\n  \"to\" is the clicked one.\n• Business narrative is generated on-demand via LLM —\n  show \"Generating summary...\" loading state on first view.\n• Narrative is cached after first generation —\n  subsequent views load instantly.\n• Component items are not expandable in this design.\n  (Expandable docstring diffs are a future enhancement.)\n• NavPanel remains visible with the same date navigation,\n  showing the active week highlighted for context.",
